* TLV9004 quad operational amplifier
* Self-contained. No .include, no wrapper subcircuits.
* Generated from TI macromodel TLV9002 Rev. C (Copyright 2018 Texas Instruments).
* Internal helper subcircuits carry the suffix _T4 so this file can be loaded
* alongside the other TLV900x libraries without redefinition clashes.

* Ports are package pins 1 through 14 in order.
* The four amplifiers are inlined, not instantiated, so that this file
* adds no subcircuit nesting beyond what the TI macromodel already uses.

.SUBCKT TLV9004 OUT1 IN1- IN1+ VCC IN2+ IN2- OUT2 OUT3 IN3- IN3+ VEE IN4+ IN4- OUT4
